There are some service (e.g. Gerrit, SigNoz - neither in ports tree)
that require you to do incremental upgrades from one version to the
next. i.e. they can't go 5 -> 8, they have to go 5 -> 6 -> 7 -> 8.

This seems to conflict with the ports tree design, which is a version
snapshot in time. However, it's not uncommon.

Thoroughly research ports tree, ports framework, porter's handbook, and
mailing lists to see if there are any ports for services that require
these incremental upgrades. I want to know if this problem has been
solved in the ports tree before.
